flowchart LR
    Client[클라이언트]:::client
    TransferAPI[Transfer-API]:::svc
    PG[(PostgreSQL<br/>transactions / users)]:::store
    Outbox[(transfer_events<br/>Outbox)]:::store
    Redis[(Redis<br/>daily limit cache)]:::store
    Relay[Transfer-Relay<br/>Spring Batch]:::svc
    Kafka{{Kafka<br/>transfer-transaction-events}}:::queue

    FdsA[Kafka Streams A<br/>processTransferEvents]:::stream
    FdsB[Kafka Streams B<br/>detectSuspiciousPatterns<br/>10분 윈도우]:::stream
    Listener[KafkaListener<br/>SuspiciousPatternAlertConsumer]:::svc
    FraudDB[(fraud_detections)]:::store
    AlertsDB[(suspicious_pattern_alerts)]:::store

    AnalysisTopic{{fds-analysis-results}}:::queue
    SuspiciousTopic{{suspicious-patterns}}:::queue

    Client -->|HTTP POST /transfer| TransferAPI
    TransferAPI -->|@Transactional| PG
    TransferAPI -->|@Transactional| Outbox
    TransferAPI -->|INCRBY| Redis
    Outbox -->|MOD partition + SKIP LOCKED| Relay
    Relay -->|Avro produce| Kafka
    TransferAPI -->|동기 send 성공 케이스| Kafka

    Kafka --> FdsA
    Kafka --> FdsB
    FdsA -->|JPA save| FraudDB
    FdsA -->|publish| AnalysisTopic
    FdsB -->|publish| SuspiciousTopic
    SuspiciousTopic --> Listener
    Listener -->|JPA save| AlertsDB

    classDef client fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1e40af,color:#1e3a8a
    classDef svc fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#14532d
    classDef store fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#7f1d1d
    classDef queue fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#a16207,color:#713f12
    classDef stream fill:#e0e7ff,stroke:#4f46e5,color:#312e81
